   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c63b9020",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🌱 MH-Weed16: YOLO11 Object Detection, Agricultural Feature Engineering & Hyperparameter Evolution\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** MH-Weed16 Multiclass Weed Dataset (Maharashtra, India)  \n",
    "**Total Images:** 6,656 high-resolution field images (1920×1080) with 61,800+ bounding boxes across 15 weed species  \n",
    "**Target Detector:** Ultralytics YOLO11 Nano (`yolo11n.pt`)  \n",
    "**Hardware Target:** Intel(R) Arc(TM) Graphics / PyTorch Device Adaptive  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 End-to-End Pipeline Architecture:\n",
    "1. **System & Hardware Diagnostic**: GPU/Arc detection, library verification, and hardware-adaptive settings.\n",
    "2. **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) & Label Integrity Audit**: Class frequencies, bounding box geometry, and sample visualizer.\n",
    "3. **Agricultural Feature Engineering & Image Preparation**:\n",
    "   - Contrast Limited Adaptive Histogram Equalization (**CLAHE**) in LAB color space for lighting normalization.\n",
    "   - Spectral vegetation indices: **Excess Green Index (ExG)** and **Normalized Difference Green/Red Index (NGRDI)**.\n",
    "   - Spatial canopy density: Weed foliage area coverage ratio (%) and count per image.\n",
    "   - Top-down agricultural rotation/flip invariance pipeline.\n",
    "4. **Dataset Partitioning (Zero-Duplication 80/10/10 Split)**:\n",
    "   - Path-index splits (`train.txt`, `val.txt`, `test.txt`) referencing existing images without disk duplication.\n",
    "   - Cross-platform `labels` directory junction mapping to `annotations/`.\n",
    "   - Automated generation of `mhweed16.yaml`.\n",
    "5. **Genetic Algorithm Hyperparameter Evolution (`model.tune`)**:\n",
    "   - Mutation-based evolution across 20+ continuous and discrete hyperparameters (`lr0`, `lrf`, `momentum`, `weight_decay`, `box`, `cls`, `dfl`, `mosaic`, `flipud`, etc.).\n",
    "   - Multi-metric fitness tracking: $\\text{Fitness} = 0.1 \\times \\text{mAP}_{50} + 0.9 \\times \\text{mAP}_{50-95}$.\n",
    "   - Automatic export to `best_hyperparameters.yaml`.\n",
    "6. **Comprehensive Hyperparameter Visual Analytics Suite**:\n",
    "   - Hyperparameter vs. Fitness scatter plots with trendlines.\n",
    "   - Generation fitness progression curve across iterations.\n",
    "   - Parameter-to-metric correlation heatmap.\n",
    "   - Multi-metric comparative bar chart across top candidate configurations.\n",
    "7. **Final Model Training**: Full training run using the evolved optimal hyperparameters.\n",
    "8. **Held-Out Test Set Evaluation**: Precision, Recall, mAP50, mAP50-95, and confusion matrix.\n",
    "9. **Qualitative Visual Inference**: Side-by-side Ground Truth vs. YOLO11 predictions with confidence scores.\n",
    "10. **Model Export & Edge Deployment**: Exporting to ONNX and OpenVINO for accelerated edge inference.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
